{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"保罗·格雷厄姆·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"paul-graham","categoryLabel":"保罗·格雷厄姆","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/08_paul-graham/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷讲述保罗·格雷厄姆（Paul Graham，1964年11月13日— ）的人生历程。他是英裔美籍的程序员、创业者、风险投资人与随笔作家，电子商务公司 Viaweb 的联合创始人、创业孵化器 Y Combinator 的联合创始人，集技术、商业与思想于一身。从英格兰韦茅斯的童年，到哈佛的计算机科学博士与佛罗伦萨的绘画进修；从用 Lisp 写就的 Viaweb 被雅虎以约4960万美元收购，到2005年与杰西卡·利文斯顿等人创办 Y Combinator——格雷厄姆的人生是一条「制造者本能 + 哲学式清晰 + 艺术家视角」三线交织的轨迹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷讲什么-与兄弟卷的分工\">本卷讲什么（与兄弟卷的分工）</h2><p>本仓库为格雷厄姆设有六卷。<strong>本卷（生平与时代）只讲「人生事件与时间线」</strong>——他在何时、何地、因何做了什么；它<strong>不</strong>展开对各项贡献的方法论或商业模式分析，那些交给兄弟卷，避免重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 生平与时代（本卷）</td>\n<td>人生事件、时间线、身份转变</td>\n<td>「发生了什么」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>YC 模式、创业哲学、随笔观点的系统拆解</td>\n<td>「贡献是什么、怎么运作」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>编程语言设计、独立思考等方法论</td>\n<td>「他的思维方式」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>对其观点与影响的批评和评价</td>\n<td>「该如何评判他」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>例如：Viaweb 的<strong>创业故事</strong>在本卷，但「Do Things that Don&#39;t Scale」这条<strong>方法论</strong>在卷2；YC 的<strong>创办经过</strong>在本卷，但 YC 的<strong>标准条款与加速器机制</strong>在卷2。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构\">三章结构</h2><p>本卷分为三章，对应格雷厄姆人生的三个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;    title 保罗·格雷厄姆人生时间线&#10;    1964 : 生于英格兰韦茅斯&#10;    1968 : 举家迁居美国匹兹堡&#10;    1986 : 康奈尔哲学学士&#10;    1990 : 哈佛 CS 博士 → 转学绘画&#10;    1993-95 : 《On Lisp》《ANSI Common Lisp》&#10;    1995 : 创办 Viaweb(Lisp 写就)&#10;    1998 : 雅虎收购 Viaweb(~4960万美元)&#10;    2005 : 创办 Y Combinator&#10;    2014 : 卸任 YC 总裁,回归写作&#10;    2019 : 发布 Lisp 方言 Bel 规范\">timeline\n    title 保罗·格雷厄姆人生时间线\n    1964 : 生于英格兰韦茅斯\n    1968 : 举家迁居美国匹兹堡\n    1986 : 康奈尔哲学学士\n    1990 : 哈佛 CS 博士 → 转学绘画\n    1993-95 : 《On Lisp》《ANSI Common Lisp》\n    1995 : 创办 Viaweb(Lisp 写就)\n    1998 : 雅虎收购 Viaweb(~4960万美元)\n    2005 : 创办 Y Combinator\n    2014 : 卸任 YC 总裁,回归写作\n    2019 : 发布 Lisp 方言 Bel 规范</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 早年与 Lisp</strong>：<a href=\"early-life-and-lisp/early-years-and-education\">早年与求学</a>（英美迁徙、哲学本科、CS 博士、转身学画）；<a href=\"early-life-and-lisp/the-lisp-hacker\">Lisp 黑客</a>（为什么是 Lisp、两本书、自造方言 Arc 与 Bel）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 Viaweb 创业</strong>：<a href=\"viaweb-and-yahoo/founding-viaweb\">创办 Viaweb</a>（三位创始人、SaaS 雏形、用 Lisp 换技术杠杆）；<a href=\"viaweb-and-yahoo/the-yahoo-acquisition\">被雅虎收购</a>（4960万美元、财务自由、人生分水岭）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 Y Combinator 岁月</strong>：<a href=\"y-combinator-years/founding-y-combinator\">创办 Y Combinator</a>（2005年第一批8家、批次模式）；<a href=\"y-combinator-years/the-essayist\">随笔作家</a>（写作即思考、清晰文风、影响一代人）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>想了解一个人</strong>：按章节顺序读即可，本卷是一条完整的人生叙事链。</li>\n<li><strong>关心创业/投资</strong>：从<a href=\"viaweb-and-yahoo/founding-viaweb\">创办 Viaweb</a> → <a href=\"viaweb-and-yahoo/the-yahoo-acquisition\">被雅虎收购</a> → <a href=\"y-combinator-years/founding-y-combinator\">创办 Y Combinator</a>，再跳到<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">卷2：核心贡献</a>看方法论。</li>\n<li><strong>关心技术/编程语言</strong>：从<a href=\"early-life-and-lisp/the-lisp-hacker\">Lisp 黑客</a>入手，再读<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">卷3：思想与方法</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>关心写作/思想</strong>：从<a href=\"y-combinator-years/the-essayist\">随笔作家</a>入手，再读<a href=\"../core-contributions/essays-and-ideas/\">卷2：随笔与思想</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：本卷面向一般读者，无需技术背景；涉及 Lisp 之处都给出了通俗解释。若想深入技术细节，可在读完本卷后转入卷3。</p>\n<p>透过格雷厄姆的生平，读者将看到一位兼具黑客精神与人文情怀的独特人物——以及他的每一段人生经历，如何环环相扣地塑造了下一段。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-lisp","title":"早年与Lisp","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/early-life-and-lisp","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-years-and-education","title":"早年与求学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/early-life-and-lisp/early-years-and-education"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-lisp-hacker","title":"Lisp 黑客","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/early-life-and-lisp/the-lisp-hacker"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"viaweb-and-yahoo","title":"Viaweb创业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/viaweb-and-yahoo","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-viaweb","title":"创办 Viaweb","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/viaweb-and-yahoo/founding-viaweb"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-yahoo-acquisition","title":"被雅虎收购","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/viaweb-and-yahoo/the-yahoo-acquisition"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"y-combinator-years","title":"Y Combinator岁月","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/y-combinator-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-y-combinator","title":"创办 Y Combinator","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/y-combinator-years/founding-y-combinator"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-essayist","title":"随笔作家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/life-and-times/y-combinator-years/the-essayist"}]}]}